  "slug": "creamy-gnocchi-with-vegetables-recipe-7970546",
  "name": "Creamy Gnocchi with Vegetables",
  "recipe_type": "side",
  "brief_description": "This creamy gnocchi with vegetables, made from prepared gnocchi, frozen vegetables, and a quick herbed cheese sauce, is very fast to make and a great addition to meatless Monday.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Melt butter in a skillet over medium heat. Add gnocchi and vegetables, and cook until vegetables are tender and gnocchi is golden, about 5 minutes."
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "text": "Stir in evaporated milk, pesto, and alouette cheese, and cook until sauce is smooth and evenly coats gnocchi and vegetables, about 5 minutes. Serve immediately."
    }
  ],
